# Log Directory Placeholder - Agent v1
#
# This directory contains log files for Zabbix Agent v1 (zabbix_agentd).
# 
# The log file path is configured in zabbix_agentd.conf:
# LogFile=%%INSTALL_PATH%%\log\agent\agent.log.txt
#
# During installation, this directory is created automatically and
# the installer expands the %%INSTALL_PATH%% macro to the actual path.
#
# Log files are excluded from git (see .gitignore).
# This placeholder ensures the directory structure exists in the repository.
